P3para.Text:
for  “contract for the transfer of goods” substitute “
                    relevant contract for the transfer of goods
                  ”;

for  “contract for the hire of goods” substitute “
                    relevant contract for the hire of goods
                  ”;

P2para.Text:
In subsection (2)(a), at the beginning insert “
                    except as provided by subsection (2A),
                  ”.

P4para.Text:
for  “that individual” substitute “
                        that person
                      ”;
